  <h1>Haskell vs Rust</h1>
  <div class="artmeta"><span>Por Coldwast</span><span>Actualizado 20 sept. 2026</span><span>9 min de lectura</span><span class="tag">#haskell</span><span class="tag">#rust</span></div>
